{
  "id": "464",
  "title": "Say Mommy",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-04-25",
  "synopsis": "In some areas in China, even doctors sometimes don't speak perfect standard mandarin.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/718/bdb3ca6119fcaea2d19f0d10bb852cfa54c1d91a.mp3?1523344609",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "叫妈妈\n\n    小明脚疼去看医生。\n    医生对小明说：“叫妈妈。”\n    小明很奇怪地看着医生。\n    医生又说：“叫妈妈。”\n    小明心想，你不是我妈妈呀。但看到医生要生气了，只好小声地叫了一声妈妈。\n    医生听到后，笑了，说：“我是问你‘脚麻吗’？”",
    "traditional": "叫媽媽\n\n    小明腳疼去看醫生。\n    醫生對小明說：“叫媽媽。”\n    小明很奇怪地看著醫生。\n    醫生又說：“叫媽媽。”\n    小明心想，你不是我媽媽呀。但看到醫生要生氣了，只好小聲地叫了一聲媽媽。\n    醫生聽到後，笑了，說：“我是問你‘腳麻嗎’？”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Say Mommy"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明脚疼去看医生。",
      "traditional": "小明腳疼去看醫生。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng jiǎo téng qù kàn yī shēng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming's leg was hurting and he went to the doctor."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "医生对小明说：“叫妈妈。”",
      "traditional": "醫生對小明說：“叫媽媽。”",
      "pinyin": "yī shēng duì xiǎo míng shuō jiào mā ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The doctor said to Little Ming: “Say mommy”."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明很奇怪地看着医生。",
      "traditional": "小明很奇怪地看著醫生。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng hěn qí guài de kàn zhe yī shēng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming looked at the doctor strangely."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "医生又说：“叫妈妈。”",
      "traditional": "醫生又說：“叫媽媽。”",
      "pinyin": "yī shēng yòu shuō jiào mā ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The doctor said again: “Say mommy”."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明心想，你不是我妈妈呀。",
      "traditional": "小明心想，你不是我媽媽呀。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng xīn xiǎng nǐ bú shì wǒ mā ma ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "但看到医生要生气了，只好小声地叫了一声妈妈。",
      "traditional": "但看到醫生要生氣了，只好小聲地叫了一聲媽媽。",
      "pinyin": "dàn kàn dào yī shēng yào shēng qì le zhǐ hǎo xiǎo shēng de jiào le yì shēng mā ma",
      "english": "Little Ming thought to himself: “You're not my mother.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "But he noticed that the doctor was about to get angry, so he had no choice but to say “mommy” in a low voice."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "医生听到后，笑了，说：“我是问你‘脚麻吗’？”",
      "traditional": "醫生聽到後，笑了，說：“我是問你‘腳麻嗎’？”",
      "pinyin": "yī shēng tīng dào hòu xiào le shuō wǒ shì wèn nǐ jiǎo má ma",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
